<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
    <title>Reservation confirmed</title>
  </head>
  <body style="font-family: system-ui, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5; color: #111;">
    <p>Hello{{#if email}} {{email}}{{/if}},</p>
    <p>
      Your reservation for <strong>{{eventTitle}}</strong> is confirmed.
    </p>
    <ul style="padding-left: 1.25rem;">
      <li>Reservation number: <strong>{{reservationNumber}}</strong></li>
      <li>Ticket type: <strong>{{ticketTypeName}}</strong></li>
      <li>Quantity: <strong>{{quantity}}</strong></li>
    </ul>
    <p>Keep this email for your records. We look forward to seeing you at the event.</p>
  </body>
</html>
